.omm directory format
---------------------
The on-disk format (a `.omm/` directory, one subdirectory per perspective,
the field files description.md, diagram.mmd, context.md, constraint.md,
concern.md, todo.md, and note.md, nested child directories, plus
meta.yaml and config.yaml) follows the format published by oh-my-mermaid:

  https://github.com/oh-my-mermaid/oh-my-mermaid
  Copyright (c) 2025 oh-my-mermaid
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Files under fixtures/from-omm/ are excerpts of that project's own `.omm`
example, copied so oh-my-pele can be tested against real documents. Those
excerpts remain under the MIT License, copyright oh-my-mermaid.

The pele-scan skill describes the same directory layout in original wording.
It is not a copy of the oh-my-mermaid skill text.

pele
----
Diagrams are rendered by the pele library, used as the published npm
package (not by copying its source into this repository):

  https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele
  Copyright (c) 2026 kepano
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Pele's zoom-reset icon is "rotate-ccw" from Lucide (ISC License). That
icon ships inside pele. oh-my-pele does not vendor Lucide source.
